j8aRkADyQJu3LsVori5Cyqx4PvFV9b8XbrA7oB-0BkhvvA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvWnj9cQJ3-REL5zm4Id-TW2pW7xoYfGbssnHKZfU8TMw&oe=699F07E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Landscape_Trains_VR.png", "id": "1686115994800774", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12138782_1686116001467440_2909541305942016000_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=k55-NbgSIksQ7kNvwHAnQAw&_nc_oc=AdmOVZ2P_Y-Y-_N347-zwsvkRnklM2spTBGqfbGGnxvKOcZUjUSHH-C64u866ApmZjM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afvikk5M_EtbvJHzLUmNUW3MXJd8mi-SCwkp6OxxxTF42Q&oe=699EF421"}, "display_name": "Trains VR", "keywords": ["trains", "puzzle", "rail", "ride", "model"], "long_description": "For thousands of years people have dreamed about traveling. As a species we have achieved a lot - millions of railroad kilometers, endless highways and the fact that at any given moment there are half a million people flying around in the sky. We are even on the verge of space-tourism \ufffd. However, the most important journey is still beyond our reach... Or is it?\n\nTrains VR gives you the ultimate opportunity to find the best-fitting solution to railroad problems. Construct your route and ride on! Dive into a fantasy world of locomotives, stations and stars. Collect them all and become a master of the railroads.\n \nWith 40 levels you can challenge yourself with logical puzzles that have multiple solutions. Become a master builder and the fastest conductor.", "short_description": "Build your model railway and then transfer yourself into its world. Solve logistic challenges, gather cargo, use switches, tunnels and turntables. Immerse yourself in the magical world of model trains."}]}, "developer_name": "The House of Fables", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thehouseoffables.com/en/projects/vr-trains/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thehouseoffables.com/en/projects/vr-trains/", "publisher_name"